_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1341120009:1":{"text":"请不必道歉。我只是在陈述事实而已。","source_cn":"请不必道歉。我只是在陈述事实而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9959CEE87C128DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1341120011:1":{"text":"实际上，就算齐格蒙德活着，将灵魂出卖给恶魔、自愿成为恶魔傀儡的他也不配再统治这片土地了。","source_cn":"实际上，就算齐格蒙德活着，将灵魂出卖给恶魔、自愿成为恶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CDA81CB3ABCE8EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1341120012:1":{"text":"这个爵位、这个公国——这里的一切都是因为对抗恶魔而来。先祖们为此流血和死亡，后代却将这份牺牲自愿献给恶魔……真是个笑话。","source_cn":"这个爵位、这个公国——这里的一切都是因为对抗恶魔而来。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28843B88C7BF3521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1341120013:1":{"text":"从第一次神魔大战后，瓦勒沙家族就一直遭受零散出现的恶魔与恶魔眷属的报复，好几个支脉都断绝在魔物的屠戮之下，包括我弟弟那一支。","source_cn":"从第一次神魔大战后，瓦勒沙家族就一直遭受零散出现的恶魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B12DA90BC84FF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1341120014:1":{"text":"你还有个弟弟？","source_cn":"你还有个弟弟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633F6A9D25FBA624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do